/-!
# Conditional transvection endgame for Lemma 16.4.6

The marked ambient action proves the relation vz = ur, fusion of u with v,
the common fixed line and its complementary plane, and the obstruction to an
additional transvection centered at z. `Configuration` keeps the actual
centralizers, conjugate component, Sylow subgroup and local two-group models.

The local D-fusion argument, the construction of the additional normalizer,
action-image recognition, and both transfer quotients remain to be assembled.
This module therefore does not assert the completed endgame or Lemma 16.4.6.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
Lemma 16.4.6, printed pp.1185–1186.
-/
